			<div class="content" id="post-content-4850060">
									

<p>A potential GoI or collective group of SCPs.</p>
<p>Please note I am reposting this as I did not use the correct format for an SCP submission in my previous post. My apologies.</p>
<p>Seeking Greenlights: Yes.</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article/GoI Format</p>
<p>Genre (Optional): Action/Mystery</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: A room SCP that has a few anomalous properties. First of all, it is effectively an infinite white void on the inside, which then feeds off of your thoughts and subconscious to create an inconceivable, strange reality inside. Second, the anomalous properties will not take place if you enter the room without knocking. Third, if you venture deep enough, you will find 13 other rooms. The premise here is that there are 13 other rooms with similar anomalous properties, that being, they're all detached rooms, they all won't activate unless you knock, and they all have the same feature where if you venture deep enough, you'll find somewhat of a link to the other 13 rooms. This is what confirmed the link between these SCPs, and what caused them to identify them collectively as, essentially, one.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: This SCP destroyed a suburb, named Billowgreens. Where's Billowgreens, you ask? The premise here is that everyone who knew about Billowgreens was given Class-A amnestics, to not remember the disaster. It was caused by an accident, where a person walked in and out of the room and unfortunately spread the &quot;room reality&quot; outside into the real world, which then tore apart &quot;real reality&quot; and became more and more chaotic the more people were stepping in it. It was eventually quarantined, and what was once Billowgreens is now a containment site for this new reality,</p>
<div>
<p>Hook/Attention-Grabber: Reality bending room SCP that spreads like a virus once it's outside the room. Destroyed an entire suburb.</p>
<p>Additional Notes: As previously mentioned, i believe this could work as a new GoI, or a collective group of these 14 room SCPs.</p>
</div>

