			<div class="content" id="post-content-4849986">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlight:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Mystery</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> Jejunu was discovered after a few strange, misfortunate, events that lead to the death of several pets and persons. Jejunu’s origins are unknown, but clues come along the way. Researchers find out, the hard way, it makes humans dangerously hungry. Jejunu may seem like just another SCP, but it soon becomes clear it desires knowledge about the foundation. For malicious reasons? Maybe. It seems to desire knowledge that it, more specifically, should not have.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> After this SCP is captured, researchers in the foundation interview this SCP and begin to see, besides being extremely hungry, it’s just as curious about them as they are about it. A few interviews and tests lead to the discovery of it’s abilities and it’s constant need to eat. Jejunu makes an escape, learns a few things about the facility, and is subsequently placed back into confinement with ease. With each interview it becomes more uncomfortable and hungry until an incident inevitably happens.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
